  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“This one’s not exactly my style.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Entropist 1st, shuffling focus class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one element in your array. Whenever you roll for shuffling focus or use your bend fate ability, reroll any dice that would give you the element chosen for this feat. You cannot choose this element for favored focus and cannot select it if you normally would be able to with your bend fate ability, but you can still learn wild talents of the chosen element as normal. This feat cannot be taken if you have the wide array feat, and must be taken at entropist level 1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc49\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
